        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The pipeline is a Stage 0–10 sequence with three inserted sub-stages, 2a, 3b, and the optional numerical stage 7b, organized into the three phases of Figure 1. Each stage writes a named file that can be inspected, revised, and reused. Table 2 lists the stages together with the gate and human checkpoint that follow each, and the failure mode(s) from Table 1 each primarily targets.",
            "block_bbox": [
